WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:02.327
It's a piece of plastic with a Radio
Shack antenna attached to it.

00:01:02.351 --> 00:01:04.317
You could dowse for all sorts of things,

00:01:04.341 --> 00:01:07.734
but this particular one was built
to dowse for marijuana

00:01:07.758 --> 00:01:08.976
in students' lockers.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.460
(Laughter)

00:01:11.484 --> 00:01:15.029
So the way it works
is you go down the hallway,

00:01:15.053 --> 00:01:18.052
and you see if it tilts
toward a particular locker,

00:01:18.076 --> 00:01:19.520
and then you open the locker.

00:01:19.544 --> 00:01:21.121
So it looks something like this.

00:01:21.145 --> 00:01:22.328
I'll show you.

00:01:23.809 --> 00:01:24.976
(Laughter)

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.391
Well, it has kind of a right-leaning bias.

00:01:28.415 --> 00:01:31.220
Well, this is science,
so we'll do a controlled experiment.